  "key_insight": "Multi-turn state mismatches occur when models defer state-modifying tool calls due to perceived authentication gaps, even when sufficient context exists. Treat access codes and cardholder names as valid booking credentials; execute booking and invoice retrieval as discrete, sequential calls rather than blocking on narrative credential requests."
